 "text": "-->\nTax Mapping / GIS | huroncounty\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nHuron County\nYour Welcoming Neighbor\nCommunity Info\nSmart 911 Signup\nAccessibility\nHome\nMeetings Calendar\nElections\nDepartments\nEmployment Opportunities\nForms & Applications\nRFP's\nProjects\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nLog In\nHuron County Tax Mapping Department /\nGeographic Information Systems\n250 East Huron Avenue\nRoom 306\nBad Axe, MI 48413\nPhone: 989-269-9421\n​\n​\nFetch GIS Digital Plat Book\nInstructions for using FetchGIS\nFetchGIS Measurement Tools\nAssessing & Tax Search / FetchGIS\nArchived Plat Book &\nLand Owner Records\nLink Courtesy of Bad Axe Public Library\nNow Accepting Credit Cards\nNeed to estimate footages or acreages of parcels?\n​\nUse the \"FetchGIS Measurement Tools\" button on the left side of the screen to learn how.\nClick here for updated info on our hours\nPrinted Plat Books are available for purchase at the MSU Extension Office\n690 N. Port Crescent, Bad Axe, MI 48413\n(Across from the Peppermill Restaurant)\nInformation Available\n​\nFetch GIS (see link to left)\nGIS Tax Parcel Maps ​\nOwnership Information\n2020 Aerials\nFor other Plat Books see link to the left\nLaminating (up to 11\" wide)\nAll Maps Can Be Printed Up To 36\" Wide\nStaff\nCody Horton - GIS Director\nTara Lawrence, GIS Technician\nGeneral Office Hours\nMonday - Thursday 8:30 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\n(Excluding Holidays)\n​\n​\nNote: Physical parcel changes will not be reflected in FetchGIS until the following April after Equalization session is completed.\nClick here to view the County map at FetchGIS.com\n​\n250 E. Huron Ave\nBad Axe, MI 48413\n​\n​\nCounty Court Hours:\n8:30 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nMonday through Friday\n​\nCounty Office Hours:\n8:00 a.m. – 4:30 p.m.\nMonday through Friday\nHuron County Building\nHuron County is committed to making our website accessible to all users, including those with disabilities. If you have specific questions or feedback about this site’s accessibility or need assistance using specific features, please email the Huron County CIS department at cis@co.huron.mi.us.\nHome\nMeetings Calendar\nElections\nDepartments\nEmployment Opportunities\nForms & Applications\nRFP's\nProjects\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nbottom of page",
